        "description": "**Job Title: Python Developer** \n\n\n\n\n**Employment Type: W2 / Full\\-Time** \n\n\n\n\n**Location: United States (Onsite / Hybrid / Remote – Based on Client Requirement)** \n\n\n\n\n**Visa: Open to all work\\-authorized candidates except H1B** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities:**\n\n\n\n* Design, develop, test, deploy, and maintain scalable enterprise applications using Python and object\\-oriented programming.\n* Develop REST APIs, Microservices, backend services, and distributed applications using FastAPI, Django, and Flask.\n* Implement business logic, data processing, automation workflows, integrations, and backend services.\n* Design and integrate relational and NoSQL databases including PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis, and DynamoDB.\n* Develop integrations with third\\-party APIs, cloud services, enterprise applications, databases, and external data sources.\n* Implement authentication, authorization, logging, exception handling, monitoring, security, and API protection mechanisms.\n* Develop automated unit, integration, API, and functional tests using PyTest, Unittest, Mock, and related testing frameworks.\n* Containerize applications using Docker and deploy scalable services using Kubernetes and cloud platforms.\n* Implement CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD, Azure DevOps, and other DevOps tools.\n* Collaborate with Business Analysts, Data Engineers, Data Scientists, QA Engineers, DevOps Engineers, Architects, and Product teams.\n* Troubleshoot production issues, perform root\\-cause analysis, optimize application performance, and provide ongoing production support.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Contact:**\n\n\n\n\n**Mahesh Kyadari, Lead – Talent Management Team** \n\n\n\n\n 📧 maheshk@precisiontechcorp.com",
